{"1652050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cast Ashore", "steam_appid": 1652050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: The game is still in development, many more things are yet to be added or shown on the steam page. Updates to the page and a EA release date coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast Ashore is a survival-based exploration game that is set in a remote archipelago in the Pacific Ocean. Explore the vast open world and survive by gathering food and resources. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Resources. Craft. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/07359b2e15409fb78869aa5ef8d065ad.webp?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/5b3bed21f6b05201e6df4030aac0acac.avif?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=170 /></span>You're an aerospace engineer aboard the &quot;Fusion Voyager&quot; headed for Mars when a critical failure compromises the mission. You are the only survivor of the crash. Scavenge resources and food while trying to stay alive. Craft tools and weapons which will help you to explore the archipelago. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build structures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/07359b2e15409fb78869aa5ef8d065ad.webp?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/6fd704d2fbfca57ef9c9736a4826deb5.avif?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With plenty of structures to choose from, build your very own home on an island or even on a raft. From the basic palm fronds shelter to a fully established wooden or metal base with everything you need to survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate the Open Ocean in Search of Answers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/07359b2e15409fb78869aa5ef8d065ad.webp?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/e25b0c0c20a0ad41283ae4d5f394f25b.avif?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why has such a well planned and calculated mission to Mars resulted in a catastrophe? How come nobody has come looking for survivors? Search the ocean for answers all across the archipelago. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Archipelago</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/07359b2e15409fb78869aa5ef8d065ad.webp?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/f7f21f140195165e79005fa7a3a2852b.avif?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a raft from the resources you find and set sail to explore. Improve your raft by building everything you might need to survive on it. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/07359b2e15409fb78869aa5ef8d065ad.webp?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=25 /></span>Music and sound effects are made by Haakon Davidsen. Join the Cast Ashore discord server to keep up-to-date with any new features or updates about the development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: The game is still in development, many more things are yet to be added or shown on the steam page. Updates to the page and a EA release date coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast Ashore is a survival-based exploration game that is set in a remote archipelago in the Pacific Ocean. Explore the vast open world and survive by gathering food and resources. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Resources. Craft. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/07359b2e15409fb78869aa5ef8d065ad.webp?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/5b3bed21f6b05201e6df4030aac0acac.avif?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=170 /></span>You're an aerospace engineer aboard the &quot;Fusion Voyager&quot; headed for Mars when a critical failure compromises the mission. You are the only survivor of the crash. Scavenge resources and food while trying to stay alive. Craft tools and weapons which will help you to explore the archipelago. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build structures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/07359b2e15409fb78869aa5ef8d065ad.webp?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/6fd704d2fbfca57ef9c9736a4826deb5.avif?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With plenty of structures to choose from, build your very own home on an island or even on a raft. From the basic palm fronds shelter to a fully established wooden or metal base with everything you need to survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate the Open Ocean in Search of Answers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/07359b2e15409fb78869aa5ef8d065ad.webp?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/e25b0c0c20a0ad41283ae4d5f394f25b.avif?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why has such a well planned and calculated mission to Mars resulted in a catastrophe? How come nobody has come looking for survivors? Search the ocean for answers all across the archipelago. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Archipelago</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/07359b2e15409fb78869aa5ef8d065ad.webp?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/f7f21f140195165e79005fa7a3a2852b.avif?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a raft from the resources you find and set sail to explore. Improve your raft by building everything you might need to survive on it. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/extras/07359b2e15409fb78869aa5ef8d065ad.webp?t=1756623402\" width=596 height=25 /></span>Music and sound effects are made by Haakon Davidsen. Join the Cast Ashore discord server to keep up-to-date with any new features or updates about the development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>", "short_description": "After a catastrophic rocket crash, you find yourself stranded on an island with only the ocean and unexplored land before you. Immerse yourself in a peaceful, open-world adventure where curiosity guides your journey. Survive. Build. Explore.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/942b880caa8d91ed9b0311e4383beba92c677ab1/header.jpg?t=1756623402", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/0a2b241657fc77a5045b66ba6d7dc9d43b484830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756623402", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1652050/0a2b241657fc77a5045b66ba6d7dc9d43b484830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756623402", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X6